invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_ext.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: the leaf's keyUsage passes on keyEncipherment alone, the
  openssl sslserver rule docs/webpki.md refuses: TLS 1.3 has no RSA key
  transport, so a leaf the CA marked for encryption only would sign
  CertificateVerify. The corpus row key_usage_no_digital_signature
  objects.

--- old
#define KEY_USAGE_DIGITAL_SIGNATURE 0x80
--- new
#define KEY_USAGE_DIGITAL_SIGNATURE 0xa0
